WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:02.511
(jumping)

00:00:04.483 --> 00:00:05.712
- Often times you hear people say

00:00:05.712 --> 00:00:06.689
that they've done double dutch

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:09.116
but most people have
never experienced what

00:00:09.116 --> 00:00:10.971
double dutch is now.

00:00:10.971 --> 00:00:12.692
It's a competitive sport.

00:00:12.692 --> 00:00:15.120
You're jumping so that
you'll be able to win.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.870
(dramatic music)

00:00:21.851 --> 00:00:23.088
(hip hop music)

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:24.387
My name is Khnaue Robinson.

00:00:24.387 --> 00:00:26.537
I'm a part of Floyd
Little Double Dutch team

00:00:26.537 --> 00:00:28.728
which is located in Newark, New Jersey.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:31.004
I'm 17 years old and I've
been jumping double dutch

00:00:31.004 --> 00:00:32.892
for five years.

00:00:32.892 --> 00:00:35.948
I practice with the double
dutch team three times a week.

00:00:35.948 --> 00:00:37.241
We compete four times a year

00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:39.853
and it leads up to the World Competition

00:00:39.853 --> 00:00:43.116
and my team has 19 World
Championship titles.

00:00:43.116 --> 00:00:44.851
We're currently in competition season

00:00:44.851 --> 00:00:48.268
and everyone is aiming to win the trophy.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:50.979
Joining double dutch,

00:00:50.979 --> 00:00:54.181
it gave me a safe place,
it gave me a home.

00:00:54.181 --> 00:00:56.313
This isn't just jumping rope.

00:00:56.313 --> 00:00:58.106
I was born and raised
in Newark, New Jersey

00:00:58.106 --> 00:01:01.592
and Newark is a city where
a lot of violence occurs.

00:01:01.592 --> 00:01:03.387
It's not always safe to be outside.

00:01:03.387 --> 00:01:04.924
A lot of shooting happening.

00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:06.573
I just never know what to expect.

00:01:06.573 --> 00:01:07.873
(bus engine rumbles)

00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:10.507
Growing up I didn't have
the mother relationship

00:01:10.507 --> 00:01:14.509
with my own mother so I feel
like coming to double dutch

00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:17.303
has really opened my eyes and let me know

00:01:17.303 --> 00:01:19.842
that there is people who care about me.

00:01:19.842 --> 00:01:23.016
I have a support system
whenever I need it.

00:01:23.016 --> 00:01:24.259
Double dutch is where I need to be.

00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:26.643
(school bell buzzes)

00:01:26.643 --> 00:01:27.495
(metal clinks)

00:01:27.495 --> 00:01:29.437
It takes a person with endurance.

00:01:29.437 --> 00:01:30.913
It take a person with strength.

00:01:30.913 --> 00:01:32.765
It takes a person with a positive attitude

00:01:32.765 --> 00:01:34.290
in order to be a winner,

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.901
in order to be that person
who knows how to jump.

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:39.149
In double dutch competition,

00:01:39.149 --> 00:01:42.002
the most important component
of double dutch is speed.

00:01:42.002 --> 00:01:45.089
That's how fast a jumper
in the rope can jump.

00:01:45.089 --> 00:01:47.325
(tapping)

00:01:47.325 --> 00:01:49.755
Giving the support to the jumper is a job

00:01:49.755 --> 00:01:51.201
that's really important to me

00:01:51.201 --> 00:01:53.420
because growing up I
didn't have that support

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:56.070
and I know that I want to give the support

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:57.709
that I never had to the
person who's in the rope

00:01:57.709 --> 00:02:01.882
so they can know that no matter
how many mistakes you did

00:02:01.882 --> 00:02:03.345
you can come back from it.

00:02:03.345 --> 00:02:06.003
You're still gonna be a
winner at the end of the day.

00:02:06.003 --> 00:02:08.137
They have what it takes
to win the tournament.

00:02:08.137 --> 00:02:10.804
(hip hop music)

